:: MP Town Festivals 3 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
<<set _m to Time.date.month>><<set _d to Time.date.day>>
高街布告栏侧下方的木槽里挂着四枚记载半日节令的黄铜小牌：二月二日的烛光暖窖日、五月一日的五月花柱集、八月一日的初穗尝新会，以及十一月二十二日的封港修船日。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回节令水牌 (0:02)|MP Micro Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[看下排半日铜牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (_m is 1 and _d gte 30) or (_m is 2 and _d lte 5)>>
	<<mpritualicon>><<link [[查地窖余蜡 (0:08)|MP Festival Candle 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<elseif (_m is 4 and _d gte 27) or (_m is 5 and _d lte 4)>>
	<<parkicon>><<link [[看花环彩带 (0:08)|MP Festival Maypole 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[看夏秋半日铜牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub B]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Town Festivals 3 Hub B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _m to Time.date.month>><<set _d to Time.date.day>>
木槽后半格挂着八月初穗尝新会与十一月封港修船日的两枚黄铜小牌。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前格铜牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (_m is 7 and _d gte 28) or (_m is 8 and _d lte 4)>>
	<<mpfarmicon>><<if Time.dayState is "dawn">><<link [[看头茬麦穗 (0:12)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 1]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">看头茬麦穗 (0:12)（只有清晨）</span><</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _m is 11 and _d gte 19 and _d lte 25>>
	<<mprepairicon>><<link [[查旧港船底 (0:08)|MP Festival Careen 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>

/* ==================== 1. 烛光暖窖日 (2月2日 · Candle · 5段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Candle 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
二月初的寒气仍未褪尽，狼街神殿下方的储藏地窖里点起了一排铜火盆。按照烛光暖窖日的旧例，<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>正带着年轻修士清点过冬剩下的蜂蜡块，准备重铸成新烛分给孤儿院与守夜岗棚。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿前庭 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>><<link [[刮净蜂蜡炭灰 (0:08)|MP Festival Candle 2]]>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_wax"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_wax"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>><<else>><</if>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[裁齐烛芯线 (0:07)|MP Festival Candle 2]]>>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_wax"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_wax"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<<mpritualicon>><</link>><<else>><<link [[裁齐烛芯线 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "裁齐烛芯线">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Festival Candle 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
融蜡铜锅架上炭火后，地窖里弥漫开温润的松脂与蜂蜜香气。就在往锡模里浇注第一批蜡液时，地窖北侧的通风木百叶被阵风吹开，冷空气直吹模具，再不挡住就会让新烛裂出空腔。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回地窖 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[罩住冷却锡模 (0:08)|MP Festival Candle 3]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_mold"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_mold"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[搬炭盆稳室温 (0:08)|MP Festival Candle 3]]>>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_mold"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_mold"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Candle 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
午后你拎着刚脱模的两篮蜂蜡新烛来到高街面包房。师傅正在烤制暖窖日特供的蜂蜜燕麦圆饼，准备随新烛一起送到孤儿院，但案板上的野蜂蜜罐被冻得凝结成块，一时间化不开。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:08)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link [[隔盆搅化冻蜜 (0:08)|MP Festival Candle 4]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_cake"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_cake"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<<mpfarmicon>><</link>><<else>><<link [[隔盆搅化冻蜜 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "隔盆搅化冻蜜">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[挪蜜罐回暖 (0:08)|MP Festival Candle 4]]>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_cake"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_cake"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Candle 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
暮色初临时，你与<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>、<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>一起给宅邸街和孤儿院走廊的风灯换上新铸的蜂蜡烛。
<<if $mpFestival3Clues["candle_wax"] is 1 and $mpFestival3Clues["candle_mold"] is 1>>
新烛烛芯笔直，点亮后火苗明亮温和，连一滴多余的蜡泪都没有流下。<span class="green">整条街巷的防风灯都换上了耐烧的新烛。</span>
<<else>>
有几支蜡烛带了细微气孔，你耐心地替每盏风灯调低了挡风玻罩。<span class="teal">昏黄烛光稳稳亮了起来。</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回宅邸街 (0:08)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[端麦饼回孤儿院 (0:08)|MP Festival Candle 5]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Candle 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
孤儿院饭堂里点起了暖黄的蜂蜡烛，孩子们围坐着分食香甜的蜂蜜燕麦饼。<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把神殿结余的铸烛劳务补贴交到你手里，<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>也替你留了一块最酥脆的麦饼。
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">暖窖日几桩活计都出了岔子，你只领到一碗热麦粥果腹。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_candle_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 3>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">暖窖日四桩活计圆满完成，管事发给了你 £6.50 节令厚赏。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你领到了暖窖日的 £3.50 帮工补贴。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	暖窖日的补贴已经领过，只剩热闹的余温。
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<tiredness -2>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回大厅歇息 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

/* ==================== 2. 五月花柱集 (5月1日 · Maypole · 5段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Maypole 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
五月一日上午，公园中心草坪竖起了一根漆成白绿相间的桦木花柱。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>与<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>正把十二条彩绸缎带系在柱顶花环上，然而春风吹乱了高处的绸带，有两条缎带缠在了树枝间。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回公园 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mptailoricon>><<link [[踩梯解高处彩绸 (0:07)|MP Festival Maypole 2]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_ribbon"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_ribbon"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[竹竿挑顺缎带 (0:07)|MP Festival Maypole 2]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_ribbon"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_ribbon"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<<parkicon>><</link>><<else>><<link [[竹竿挑顺缎带 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "竹竿挑顺缎带">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Festival Maypole 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
正午手风琴声响起，年轻街坊们每人牵起一条彩绸围着桦木柱交叉绕行。刚编到第三圈菱形花纹时，东侧一名学徒步点踏反，眼看整圈彩绸就要拧成死结。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退到长椅边 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[旋身带学徒步点 (0:08)|MP Festival Maypole 3]]>>
	<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_dance"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -3>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_dance"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>><<link [[拍手鼓稳节拍 (0:08)|MP Festival Maypole 3]]>>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_dance"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_dance"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<<socialiseicon "dance">><</link>><<else>><<link [[拍手鼓稳节拍 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拍手鼓稳节拍">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='blue'>C</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Festival Maypole 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "garden">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
花柱彩绸编好后，众人移步到公园花圃旁分编随身佩戴的铃兰与山楂花环。几只采蜜的野蜂围着花篮打转，把旁边帮忙的小女孩吓得不敢伸手。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link [[薄荷叶引野蜂 (0:08)|MP Festival Maypole 4]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_wreath"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_wreath"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<<parkicon>><</link>><<else>><<link [[薄荷叶引野蜂 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "薄荷叶引野蜂">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[端糖水碟到树荫 (0:08)|MP Festival Maypole 4]]>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_wreath"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_wreath"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Maypole 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
午后阳光穿过新绿树冠，白桦花柱被红白相间的彩绸裹得如同盛开的花束。
<<if $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_ribbon"] is 1 and $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_dance"] is 1>>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>用画笔速写下花柱全景，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>也将一顶沾着露珠的铃兰花冠戴在你头上。<span class="green">周围响起一片欢快的掌声。</span>
<<else>>
彩绸顶端虽有些松散，但缀上山楂花枝后依然鲜亮喜庆。<span class="teal">春风拂过面颊令人神清气爽。</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回公园 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[长桌旁喝花茶 (0:05)|MP Festival Maypole 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Maypole 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
半日花集散场前，商会执事将布置花柱的红封分给帮忙的人。你喝着清凉微甜的花茶，口袋里还揣着<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>塞给你的铃兰香囊。
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">花柱集几桩活计都出了岔子，管事只塞给你半块烤薯充饥。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_maypole_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 3>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">花柱集四桩活计圆满完成，你收下了 £6.50 头等劳务红封。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你领到了花柱集的 £3.50 帮工补贴。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	花柱集的补贴已经领过，只剩热闹的余温。
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<tiredness -2>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回街区 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

/* ==================== 3. 初穗尝新会 (8月1日 · Firstsheaf · 5段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Firstsheaf 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
八月一日清晨，向阳坡地的头茬春麦刚满金黄。按照初穗尝新会的规矩，<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>正准备割下第一束麦穗试磨新面，却发现打谷场边的石磨转轴干涩卡顿，还没筛完头斗麦粒就停了。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农田 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
