:: MP Festival Firstsheaf 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
新磨出的头茬麦粉带着浓郁的阳光麦香。正要把麦粉装袋送往收成街烤制尝新圆饼时，几只林间斑鸠落进晒麦席啄食麦粒，赶得太急又容易踩翻竹匾。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回打谷场 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
