	<<pass 12>>
<<mpcookicon>><</link>><<else>><<link [[撒谷壳引斑鸠 (0:12)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撒谷壳引斑鸠">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 12>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[摇绳护竹匾 (0:12)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 3]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_birds"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_birds"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 12>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Firstsheaf 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
午间收成街酒馆后厨的铁壁炉烧得通红，新麦粉揉入黄油与迷迭香后推进烤膛。掌柜同时煮起了一桶无醇头锅麦芽饮，让你帮忙看准火候撇去浮沫。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回成街 (0:08)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[撇净麦芽浮沫 (0:08)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 4]]>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_bake"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_bake"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[转木铲均匀烘烤 (0:08)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 4]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_bake"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_bake"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Firstsheaf 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
第一炉金黄酥脆的尝新大圆饼端上街口木桌，农夫与街坊们围拢过来掰饼尝鲜。
<<if $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_mill"] is 1 and $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_bake"] is 1>>
新麦粉细润弹牙，配着琥珀色的清甜麦芽饮，连挑剔的老磨坊主都竖起了大拇指。<span class="green">今年的头茬尝新会办得格外红火。</span>
<<else>>
圆饼边角虽烤得略硬了些，蘸着温热的麦芽饮依然香气十足。<span class="teal">热闹的欢笑声传遍了整条收成街。</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回成街 (0:08)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfarmicon>><<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>><<link [[清点结余新麦 (0:12)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 5]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><<else>><</if>>

:: MP Festival Firstsheaf 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
傍晚微风吹过麦浪，<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把一束编成平安结的金黄初穗别在你衣襟上，又将磨坊与酒馆凑出的尝新红封塞进你手心。
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">尝新会几桩活计都出了岔子，你只拿到了几块烘干的苹果片。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_firstsheaf_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 3>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">尝新会四桩活计圆满完成，主事人将 £6.50 节庆花红交到你手里。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你领到了尝新会的 £3.50 帮工补贴。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	尝新会的补贴已经领过，只剩热闹的余温。
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<tiredness -2>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿田埂回农田 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>

/* ==================== 4. 封港修船日 (11月22日 · Careen · 5段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Careen 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
十一月下旬风暴季来临前，旧港干船坞迎来了封港修船日。老船长与<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>正指挥水手把近海渔船架上木滑台，准备刮除船底积了一年的藤壶与海牡蛎。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回梅尔街 (0:02)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[铲除龙骨藤壶 (0:08)|MP Festival Careen 2]]>>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_scrape"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_scrape"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link [[钢丝刷清桨槽 (0:07)|MP Festival Careen 2]]>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_scrape"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_scrape"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<<gardenicon "water">><</link>><<else>><<link [[钢丝刷清桨槽 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "钢丝刷清桨槽">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Festival Careen 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
刮净的船底木板露出几道细微的渗水接缝。船坞边的铁锅里正熬着滚烫的松脂与焦油，必须趁热将浸过桐油的麻丝捻进木板缝里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回船坞 (0:02)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link [[捻油麻入船缝 (0:07)|MP Festival Careen 3]]>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_pitch"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_pitch"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<<mpcookicon>><</link>><<else>><<link [[捻油麻入船缝 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "捻油麻入船缝">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[看火刷匀松脂 (0:07)|MP Festival Careen 3]]>>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_pitch"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_pitch"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Careen 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
修补完船底后，众人来到栈桥边将备用麻缆盘进防潮帆布仓。一阵强劲的西北风突然掠过港湾，挂在桅杆顶端的防风测向旗绳扣脱开，眼看就要被吹落海中。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[攀副桅杆挽旗绳 (0:06)|MP Festival Careen 4]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_flag"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_flag"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>><<link [[钩缆绳抄旗角 (0:06)|MP Festival Careen 4]]>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_flag"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_flag"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<<mprowicon>><</link>><<else>><<link [[钩缆绳抄旗角 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "钩缆绳抄旗角">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 舞蹈等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Festival Careen 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
夕阳沉入铅灰色的冬海，船坞里的大小船只都涂上了乌亮防渗的松脂焦油。
<<if $mpFestival3Clues["careen_scrape"] is 1 and $mpFestival3Clues["careen_pitch"] is 1>>
老船长用木槌敲了敲严丝合缝的船底，满意地让人搬出煨在炭火上的红糖朗姆姜茶。<span class="green">整排船只都做好了越冬防风准备。</span>
<<else>>
虽然补刷焦油多费了些工夫，总算赶在天黑前把全部船底封妥。<span class="teal">水手们围在火桶旁烘烤着湿冷的手套。</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[避风棚喝姜茶 (0:05)|MP Festival Careen 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Careen 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
避风棚里热气腾腾，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>把船坞行会结算的修船津贴塞进你口袋，又递给你一枚用船底老橡木车成的平安木扣。
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">修船日几桩活计都出了岔子，你只领到一碗热麦粥果腹。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_careen_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 3>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">修船日四桩活计圆满完成，管事发给了你 £6.50 节令厚赏。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你领到了修船日的 £3.50 帮工补贴。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	修船日的补贴已经领过，只剩热闹的余温。
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<tiredness -2>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:10)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
